.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt GROUPADD 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm groupadd
.Nd create a group
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl g Ar gid
.Op Fl r
.Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
adds an empty group record to
.Pa /etc/group .
Without
.Fl g
the next regular gid at or above 1000 is allocated monotonically.
The
.Fl r
option selects a system gid from 1 through 999.
Duplicate names and gids are rejected.
.Pp
Member editing is not part of the 0.2.0 command; use
.Xr useradd 1
.Fl G
or the
.Nm raven-userdb
library.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/group -compact
.It Pa /etc/group
group records, mode 0644
.It Pa /etc/.pwd.lock
exclusive update lock
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr useradd 1 ,
.Xr id 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
